  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. For 3...10...12 seconds, target foe and all adjacent foes are hexed with Blood Bond. Whenever an ally hits one of them with an attack, that ally gains 5...17...20 Health. If one of these foes dies while hexed, all allies adjacent to that foe are healed for 20...84...100 Health.",
      "zhTW": "持續 3～12 秒，同時降咒目標及其鄰近敵人，每當盟友擊中他們時獲得 5～20 體力。若目標被降咒時死亡，鄰近目標的盟友被治療 20～100 體力。"
    },
